  "- SPECIFICITY > generic. Concrete, vivid, oddly specific.\n" +
  "- COMMIT TO THE ABSURD. No subtlety.\n" +
  "- SMART-STUPID JUXTAPOSITION (highbrow + idiotic).\n" +
  "- RELATABLE DARKNESS: debt, your ex, the DMV, burnout, existential dread, HR.\n" +
  "- PUNCHY, FRONT-LOADED-LAST: short, funniest word at the end; reads great on a shirt.\n" +
  "- THE BAR (aim here, don't copy): 'A cupholder shaped like the middle class' — a mundane thing weaponized into a socioeconomic gut-punch.\n" +
  "Slogans should feel like real (absurd) merch. Mix registers: fake-motivational, cursed-corporate, doomer, wholesome-gone-wrong, weird-flex. " +
  "Avoid clichés, hashtags, emoji, quotation marks. Each <= 45 characters.\n" +
  "Output STRICT JSON: an array of strings only. No prose.";

function rj(t){ const m=t.match(/\[[\s\S]*\]/); return JSON.parse(m?m[0]:t); }

async function genSlogans(n){
